<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24002" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δελφίς</span></b>  (later <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δελφίν</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
			Mosch.
			3.37
		</span></i> (dub.l.), <i><span class="en">
			Man.
			5.157
		</span></i>), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῖνος</span><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">,
		ὁ</span>:— 
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>dolphin,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				21.22
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				12.96
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Archil.
				74.7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>P.</u>
				2.51
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.24
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				489b2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>H.</u>
				1.648
			</span></i>, etc.; as an ornament, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				2.678
			</span></i>B<i><span class="en">
				37
			</span></i>; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βελφίν.</span>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>mass of lead shaped like a dolphin,</i> hung at the yard-arm,
			and let down on the decks of the enemy's ships, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς δ. μετεωρίζου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Eq.</u>
					762
				</span></i>
			, cf. Sch. ad loc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. κεροῦχος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pherecr.
					12
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κερκέτης</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Paus.Gr.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				118
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>H.</u>
				3.290
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>stops</i> in a machine, <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				48.4.44
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>the constellation Dolphin,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Democr.
				14
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mete.</u>
				345b22
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arat.
				316
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Eratosth.
				<u>Cat.</u>
				31
			</span></i> tit., etc.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
